/* 113 年疼痛專科歷屆考題。請保留原始題號與官方答案；醫學驗證另行記錄。 */
window.PAIN_EXAM_SEEDS=(window.PAIN_EXAM_SEEDS||[]).concat([{"id":"official-113-1","year":113,"number":1,"topic":"未分類","text":"For peripheral pain mechanisms and nociceptor sensitization, which one of the following statement is wrong?","options":["Sensory neurons commonly identified as nociceptors are those with myelinated (A-fiber) axons, big cell body diameters (> 50 μm), that terminate in the deep layers of the spinal cord dorsal horn.","The presence or absence of certain markers (e.g., the tetrodotoxin (TTX)-resistant sodium channel NaV1.8, the transient receptor potential vanilloid receptor TRPV1) have been used to identify subsets of nociceptors.","More recently, with the ability to analyze many genes expressed in a single cell, patterns of gene expression have been used to further define subpopulations of nociceptors.","With respect to cell body size and myelination, it should be appreciated that there exist some large diameter cells with heavily myelinated and rapidly conducting axons that have been documented functionally to be nociceptors.","Many non-nociceptors have unmyelinated axons, and thus, axon myelination or cell diameter cannot be applied as reliable criteria to define a nociceptor."],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。典型 nociceptors 多為小至中型 DRG 神經元，軸突常為無髓 C fiber 或薄髓鞘 Aδ fiber，投射至背角表淺層；A 所述『大細胞、粗有髓、深層終止』不是典型特徵。B 的 Nav1.8/TRPV1、C 的 single-cell transcriptomics 可用來分群；D、E 提醒不能僅憑直徑與髓鞘定義所有 nociceptor。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":1,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-2","year":113,"number":2,"topic":"未分類","text":"For substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing, which one of the following statement is wrong?","options":["The dorsal root ganglion and brainstem nuclei are home to second-order neurons, the first step of central nervous system (CNS) processing.","Although it seems like a simple statement that pain-related second-order neurons are the neurons which receive primary afferent input related to tissue damage (i.e., from nociceptors), it must be accepted that this statement may or may not be wholly true because in certain pathologic states, pain can be evoked by non–tissue-damaging stimuli (allodynia).","A proto-oncogene, c-fos, is activated after potentially tissue-damaging stimuli are applied to most tissues.","A systematic comparison study of Fos and pERK as markers of spinal nociceptive activation revealed greater specificity for activity in nociceptive pathways (vs. nonnociceptive activation) using pERK.","Analgesic pharmacologic manipulations such as systemic morphine reduce both the total number of labeled neurons and the total Fos or pERK content of the spinal cord following a noxious stimulus."],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Dorsal root ganglion（DRG）放的是初級感覺神經元（一級神經元），二級神經元主要在脊髓背角或腦幹感覺核；A 混淆。B 的 allodynia 反映原本非傷害性傳入亦可導致疼痛；C 的 c-Fos 與 D 的 pERK 為實驗活化指標，E 的 morphine 可調降傷害刺激造成的活化，皆有生理研究支持。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":1,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-3","year":113,"number":3,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of following description about \"antidepressant analgesic\" is \"Correct\"?","options":["In terms of treatment efficacy (smaller number needed to treat NNT), pregabalin is much better than tricyclic antidepressant and listed as first line therapy for neuropathic pain","In terms of treatment efficacy (smaller number needed to treat NNT), SSRI is better than SNRI for common neuropathic pain such as postherpetic neuralgia or painful diabetic polyneuropathy","Venlafaxine is effective for treatment of neuropathic pain associated with breast cancer.","For painful diabetic neuropathy, comparison of amitriptyline and pregabalin showed no difference in pain relief but fewer adverse effects with pregabalin.","All of above"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 E 有明顯矛盾：A 稱 pregabalin NNT 一定遠低於 TCA、B 稱 SSRI 優於 SNRI，均不符合一般 neuropathic pain 藥物證據；因此『A～D 都對』不可能成立。C venlafaxine 對乳癌術後神經病變痛有過研究但不能泛化；D 提及 amitriptyline 與 pregabalin 直接比較，應查原始 RCT。此題與 112 年第 8 題題面相同，112 年官方反而選 D。本站保留 113 年官方 E 並標記答案鍵疑義。","officialNote":"Chap 34 出處 Chap. 2, summary","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"AAN 2022 painful diabetic neuropathy pharmacotherapy guideline","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34965987/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":2,"parseWarning":["113 年官方 E 與 112 年相同題目官方 D 不一致；A、B 均有不成立內容，不能選 E"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-4","year":113,"number":4,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statement about the pathophysiology of herpes zoster is wrong?","options":["Herpes zoster most commonly manifests in the distribution of a single dorsal sensory or cranial nerve ganglion.","Why the reactivation of virus occurs in one ganglion when latent virus is present throughout the patient’s sensory ganglia is clear.","Declining cellular immunity is a major risk factor for reactivation of the virus, which is thought to occur when cell-mediated immunity falls below a critical level.","This impression is supported by evidence that even individuals with adequate levels of serum antibodies to varicella-zoster virus (VZV) antigen can, over time, exhibit T cells with reduced ability to proliferate and defend against VZV infections.","Cell-mediated immunity appears to play a crucial role in preventing reactivation of latent VZV."],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。VZV 潛伏在感覺神經節，帶狀疱疹常沿單側皮節出現；雖已知 VZV-specific cell-mediated immunity 下降會增加再活化風險，但為何在特定單一 ganglion 起始，並未完全釐清。因此 B 說『原因已清楚』錯。C～E 強調 T-cell immunity，血中仍有抗體不代表完全免疫保護。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain, 5e, p. 375.","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":2,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-5","year":113,"number":5,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following is the acceptable statement about neurodestructive RF lesions?","options":["These temperatures are resulted from friction heat.","The size of RF lesion with 22 gauge RF needle is around with a radius of 5 mm","The heat is generated on the tip of RF needle. The RF needle then heat up the tissues.","The RF permanent neurodestructive lesion is formed when neural temperatures exceed 42 C","All of the above"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Thermal radiofrequency lesion 的熱主要由交變電場導致電極附近組織離子運動、阻抗加熱形成，而非單純金屬針尖傳導熱。B 的 lesion 半徑不會固定 5 mm，受 active tip、溫度、時間與組織影響；D 的 42°C 不足以當作永久熱毀損的通用門檻，故 E 不成立。A 以『friction heat』形容為傳統簡寫，機制須更精確理解。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":2,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-6","year":113,"number":6,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statement is correct?","options":["Functional imaging techniques applied for the study of pain are positron emission tomography (PET), functional magnetic resonance imaging (fMRI), near-infrared spectroscopy (NIRS), multi-channel electroencephalography (EEG) and magnetoencephalography (MEG), and intracranial recordings.","NIRS is an optical approach that also analyses changes in hemoglobin oxygenation levels by using light in the near infrared range (650 to 950 nm).","EEG and MEG are noninvasive neurophysiologic techniques that measure the respective electrical potentials and magnetic fields generated by neuronal activity of the brain and propagated to the surface of the skull where they are picked up with EEG electrodes or, in the case of its magnetic counterpart, received by supra conducting quantum interference device (SQUID) sensors located outside the skull.","Invasive recordings, which are assessed during neurosurgical interventions in patients ongoing epileptic surgery, or deep brain stimulation (DBS) procedures (most common in Parkinson disease), are extremely helpful to directly measure supraspinal pain signals.","All of the above are correct."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。PET、fMRI（常見 BOLD）、NIRS、EEG、MEG 與顱內電生理記錄均可用於研究疼痛相關神經功能。A 是方法列表；B 近紅外光估計氧合血紅素變化；C EEG/MEG 量測電位／磁場；D 特殊臨床手術時的顱內記錄可提供直接神經訊號。注意這些工具不能直接取代病人主觀疼痛評估。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":3,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-7","year":113,"number":7,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statement is wrong?","options":["The person who has a chronic pain condition resides in a complex and costly world that is populated not only by themselves but also by their significant others, including health care providers, employers, and third-party payers.","People with chronic pain may feel that their health care providers, employers, and even family members are blaming them when their condition fails to respond to treatment as expected.","In the absence of cure or even substantial relief, individuals experiencing chronic pain may withdraw from contacts; lose their sources of income; alienate family, friends, and coworkers; and become more and more isolated, despondent, depressed, and, in general, demoralized.","Psychosocial and behavioral factors play an insignificant role in the experience, maintenance, and exacerbation of pain and potentially even the cause.","Because some level of pain persists in the majority of people with chronic pain regardless of treatment, self-management is an important complement to biomedical approaches."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。慢性痛受到神經生物、情緒、認知、行為、家庭與社會制度交互影響，心理社會因素『不重要』的 D 明顯錯。A～C 描述慢性痛的工作、關係與孤立風險，E 強調 self-management 作為生物醫學治療的補充；心理社會因素重要不代表疼痛是虛構。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"IASP CRPS and biopsychosocial framework","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9186375/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":3,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-8","year":113,"number":8,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列對於肌筋膜疼痛及纖維肌痛的比較，何者錯誤： Myofascial pain Fibromyalgia","options":["pain pattern: local or regional diffuse","referred pain: − +++","feature: trigger point tender point","muscle spasm: +++ ++","Taut band: ++ −"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。Myofascial pain syndrome（MPS）的 trigger point 常造成區域性 referred pain，因此 B 把 MPS 寫成『沒有轉移痛』、fibromyalgia 卻標成『+++』，方向不對。A 局部／區域 vs 全身廣泛、C trigger point vs 舊式 tender point、E taut band 與 MPS 較相關；D 肌痙攣比例沒有一致定量標準，不宜死背加號。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"EULAR fibromyalgia treatment guideline","url":"https://ard.bmj.com/content/76/2/318"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":4,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-9","year":113,"number":9,"topic":"未分類","text":"During peripheral sensitization of nociceptors, which of the coupling is wrong?","options":["prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) --- EP receptor","bradykinin --- B2 receptor","heat --- TRPV1 receptor","ATP --- P2Y receptor","all of the above are right"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E（A～D 均可參與 nociceptor sensitization）。PGE2 主要透過 EP receptors；bradykinin 經 B2；heat 常涉及 TRPV1；ATP 可藉 P2Y metabotropic receptor 或 P2X ionotropic receptor 調節。D 雖可成立，但 ATP 誘發快速痛覺傳遞常特別強調 P2X3，不能將所有 ATP 作用都歸到 P2Y。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":4,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-10","year":113,"number":10,"topic":"未分類","text":"Regarding the actions of spinal and supraspinal analgesia for opioids, which of the following statement is most likely:","options":["Opioid receptors are mostly located at a predominantly 70% postsynaptic location on the central terminals of only small diameter nociceptive primary afferents.","The contribution of kappa, delta and mu receptors to the total opiate binding throughout the spinal cord is estimated to be delta > mu >kappa.","Opioids inhibit OFF cells via GABA neurons and activate ON cells in the rostromedial medulla (RVM) leading to changes in spinal descending controls.","Nitric oxide (NO) is required for the 5-HT-mediated inhibition of PAG output and reversal of antinociception.","Fibers descending from the PAG to the dorsal horn of the spinal cord are mostly enkephalinergic, glycinergic and GABAergic."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D，但此題採用的 PAG/RVM 神經傳遞表述需核對原教材。A 說 opioid receptor 僅在小直徑傳入末梢且『70% postsynaptic』過度絕對；B 的脊髓受體比例排序不可靠；C 把 ON/OFF cell 活化方向顛倒，典型 opioid analgesia 藉抑制促痛 ON cell／促進抑痛 OFF cell；E 將 PAG 到背角直接投射及神經傳遞物過度簡化。D 關於 NO、5-HT 與 PAG 的特定路徑關係，不能據此視為所有情境的普遍定律，需查原始實驗。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":4,"parseWarning":["NO/5-HT 在 PAG 特定線路需回查 Bonica 原書；無法僅由題面獨立證實 D"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-11","year":113,"number":11,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following is the acceptable statement about pathogenesis of FMS?","options":["There is evidence to suggest that FMS is a disorder of abnormal processing of sensory information within the central nervous system.","Several neurochemical mediators of pain, substance P, nerve growth factor, dynorphin A, glutamate, nitric oxide, serotonin and noradrenaline are viewed as pronociceptive because they carry or amplify afferent signals, leading to the brain perception of increased pain.","The elevation of cerebrospinal fluid substance P in FMS is due to lowered activity of cerebrospinal fluid substance P esterase because the rate of cleavage of libeled substance P by FMS cerebrospinal fluid was lower than normal.","In different subtypes of FMS, it is believed that nerve growth factor may be responsible for the elevated cerebrospinal fluid substance P through its effects on central sensitization and neuroplasticity.","A specific Gi-protein–coupled receptor in peripheral blood leukocytes was found to be dysfunctional in patients with FMS. This resulted in lower baseline, also depressed intracellular levels of cyclic AMP and proposed as a diagnostic test for FMS."],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Fibromyalgia（FM）涉及中樞感覺訊息處理、下降疼痛調節與睡眠／情緒等多系統因素，故 A 最符合。B 把 serotonin、noradrenaline 一律列成促痛物質忽略其抑痛角色；C 將 CSF substance P 上升完全歸因降解酶是未確立假說；D NGF 可能參與但不能當所有 FM 病因；E 白血球 Gi-coupled receptor/cAMP 異常不是已驗證的 FM 特異診斷試驗。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":4,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-12","year":113,"number":12,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which drug below is less likely an option for inhibiting central sensitization following acute postoperative pain:","options":["NMDA antagonist","Opioid","COX2-inhibitor","Pre-emptive analgesia","Gabapentin"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。NMDA antagonists、COX-2 抑制、gabapentinoids 與適當 multimodal／pre-emptive analgesia 可以不同機轉減少周邊與中樞敏化；opioid 雖是強效鎮痛藥，但長期／高暴露時可能有 tolerance 與 opioid-induced hyperalgesia，不能視為預防 central sensitization 的專一方案。『較不可能』不等於術後不能用 opioid。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":5,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-13","year":113,"number":13,"topic":"未分類","text":"A 61-year-old woman presents to the pain clinic with a chief complaint of left shoulder and arm pain 3 years after undergoing radiation therapy for breast cancer. Physical examination reveals lymphedema of the left axilla with noticeable skin changes. Examination of the left supraclavicular area precipitates a sharp pain that radiates down her left arm. Which of the following is her likely diagnosis?","options":["Tumor metastasis","Cervical radiculopathy","Reflex sympathetic dystrophy","Thrombangitis obliterans","Radiation-induced plexopathy"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。乳癌放療多年後出現患側肩臂神經病變樣痛、腋下淋巴水腫與皮膚改變，應懷疑 radiation-induced brachial plexopathy。A 腫瘤再發／轉移是最重要的鑑別，需要影像或其他檢查排除；B 神經根病變通常有皮節與脊椎相關徵象；C CRPS、D Buerger disease 與放療後局部纖維化的關聯較弱。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":5,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-14","year":113,"number":14,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following is not true about post-mastectomy pain?","options":["Mastectomy may result in chronic pain in as many as half of those patients.","This pain often starts immediately or a few days postoperatively.","This pain is usually neuropathic in character.","It is suspected that the intercostobrachial nerve is often damaged during axillary node dissection","The incidence of phantom breast syndrome 1 year after surgery is less than 5%."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。持續性 postmastectomy pain 常有 neuropathic 性質，intercostobrachial nerve 在腋下淋巴結清掃中容易受損，術後疼痛可持續（A～D）。E 說一年後 phantom breast syndrome 低於 5% 過於武斷；須區分 phantom breast sensation 與 phantom breast pain，研究比例與追蹤時間差異很大。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":6,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-15","year":113,"number":15,"topic":"未分類","text":"According to the long-form McGill Pain Questionnaire (MPQ) pain rating index scores, which of the following acute pain status is rated the highest pain score?","options":["Amputation of digit","Labor pain","Abdominal gynecological surgery","Fracture.","Lower abdominal surgery (males)"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。這是依舊版 long-form McGill Pain Questionnaire（MPQ）的特定樣本 pain rating index 排列，digit amputation 被列在所列急性痛情境之首。MPQ 是受試者描述與加總的主觀量表，不是對分娩、骨折或手術『先天痛度』的客觀排序，不可將此選項用於臨床疼痛比較。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":6,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-16","year":113,"number":16,"topic":"未分類","text":"The innervation of deep somatic tissue like muscle and joint is quite complex. Which of the following description is not appropriate?","options":["The nociceptors are predominantly activated by non-physiological stimuli which may cause damage to the structures (e.g. overload, twisting, strong pressure, ischemic contraction). information within the central nervous system.","During inflammation or after trauma, nociceptors of joint and muscle show pronounced sensitization, in particular for mechanical stimuli.","Descending inhibition is enhanced during chronic inflammation but seems to be normalized during acute inflammation.","Both primary afferent fibers as well as sympathetic reflexes may aggravate inflammatory lesions.","Reduced release of hormones from the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal (HPA) axis such as cortisol, adrenal androgens and testosterone may cause a relative loss of anti-inflammatory activity.."],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。慢性發炎及神經損傷常見的是下降抑制受損或下降促痛增加，C 說慢性發炎時抑制反而增強不合常見機制。A、B 反映關節肌肉 nociceptors 對過負荷／發炎的敏化；D 交感反射與初級傳入可能放大發炎反應；E HPA 軸抗發炎荷爾蒙下降亦可能參與慢性症狀。A 題面混入另一句英文，屬擷取／排版瑕疵。","officialNote":"考題出處：P.621","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":6,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-17","year":113,"number":17,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following description about autonomic, endocrine and immune interactions in pain is correct?","options":["Signaling from the immune system to the CNS via vagal afferents and possibly small-diameter afferents innervating somatic tissues to induce sickness behavior","Modulation of the immune system and the inflammatory response by CNS circuits that control the production and release of neuroendocrine hormonal mediators in the sympathoadrenal stress axis","Coupling of the sensory nociceptive and sympathetic efferent components of the peripheral nervous system in the setting of inflammation and nerve injury to produce sympathetically maintained pain","All of above",""],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。免疫訊號可經迷走與小纖維傳向 CNS，出現 sickness behavior（A）；中樞經 sympathoadrenal／HPA 軸調節免疫與發炎（B）；炎症或神經損傷後感覺與交感互動可促成 sympathetically maintained pain（C）。所以 D 是三者皆對；各路徑有條件性，不是所有慢性痛必有交感維持成分。","officialNote":"P198","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-18","year":113,"number":18,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statements is wrong?","options":["All nociceptors are myelinated.","Following a cutaneous injury, enhanced pain in response to cutaneous stimuli, called hyperalgesia, develops at the site of injury (primary hyperalgesia) and in the surrounding uninjured skin (secondary hyperalgesia).","Tissue injury leads to enhanced responsiveness of nociceptors, called sensitization, which accounts for primary hyperalgesia.","When nerves are severed, spontaneous activity and ectopic mechanical, thermal, and chemical sensitivity develop in the injured nociceptors.",""],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。多數 C-fiber nociceptors 為無髓鞘，亦有薄髓 Aδ nociceptors，因此『所有 nociceptors 都有髓鞘』錯。B 原發性及次發性 hyperalgesia 的位置不同；C 周邊 sensitization 有助解釋原發性痛覺過敏；D 受傷神經可出現 ectopic discharge。原題只有 A～D 四個有效選項。","officialNote":"出處 Chap. 1, summary","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-19","year":113,"number":19,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statements is wrong?","options":["The perception of pain arising from a noxious stimulus starts with conversion of the energy of the stimulus into an electrical signal in the primary afferent neurons innervating the site of the stimulus.","This process of energy conversion is called transduction.","The three general modalities of noxious stimuli that impinge on the body are chemical, thermal, and mechanical.","Specific proteins or groups of proteins called transducers underlie the process of transduction.","All of the above are correct."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E 的原意為『A～D 全部正確』。Noxious stimulus 經 transducer proteins 將化學、熱、機械刺激的能量轉為 primary afferent generator potential（transduction），達閾值後產生動作電位。因 A～D 均是正確敘述，若題幹要求找『wrong』而 E 寫『all correct』，實際意思是前四項無錯，題型語意需辨認。","officialNote":"出處 Chap. 2, summary","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-20","year":113,"number":20,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statements is wrong?","options":["Pain and hyperalgesia arise in part from the action of inflammatory mediators on the peripheral terminals of nociceptive neurons.","The list of inflammatory mediators may include arachidonic acid metabolites, bradykinin, adenosine triphosphate and nitric oxide.","A series of inflammatory cytokines and chemokines, such as tumor necrosis factor-α and interleukin-1β, and growth factors, particularly nerve growth factor, are capable of changing the response properties of pain-signaling neurons.","The inflammatory mediators may activate nociceptive terminals or regulate gene expression of nociceptors.","All of the above are correct."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Prostaglandins、bradykinin、ATP、NO、TNF-α、IL-1β、NGF 等媒介物可直接活化或敏化周邊 nociceptor，且可改變離子通道與基因表現（A～D）。E 表示『前述皆對』；需區別 immediate activation 與 long-term sensitization 兩種作用時序。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-21","year":113,"number":21,"topic":"未分類","text":"骨癌或骨轉移引起之疼痛治療論述，以下一者為非，請指出。","options":["該類疼痛常引起骨骼相關事件(Skeletal-related events)，如骨折等。","該類疼痛作用機轉常合併傷害感受性及神經病變性之疼痛。","使用之藥物治療常以抗痙攣藥物為主，鴉片類藥物一般沒效。","雙磷酸盬及抗 RANK-L 抗體之藥物，可減緩骨轉移而避免疼痛。","其中因有發炎因素，非類固醇之消炎藥物也有一定的止痛效果。"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。骨轉移疼痛可能包含骨膜／骨髓破壞與局部發炎的 nociceptive pain，加上神經壓迫的 neuropathic component（A、B）。Opioids、NSAIDs、放療及骨改質藥（bisphosphonate、denosumab）均可視病況使用；C 說『以抗癲癇藥為主且 opioid 無效』錯。D 骨改質藥主要降低骨骼相關事件，不等同能保證阻止所有骨轉移或止痛。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-22","year":113,"number":22,"topic":"未分類","text":"在癌病疼痛的治療中，須作鴉片類藥物之「轉換」或「輪替」(Switching or Rotation)，以下 一者論述為非，請指出。","options":["在病人使用該鴉片類藥物，發生無法忍受的副作用時考慮使用。","病人使用之鴉片類藥物有止痛效果，但效果不佳，又無法增加劑量。","該藥長期使用後，效果開始不佳，甚至增加劑量也沒得到更好效果。","在轉換前已有效控制疼痛者，算出的日總劑量應減少 25-50%為準。","在轉換前效果己經不理想者，算出的日總劑量應增加 50-100%為準。"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Opioid rotation 常因副作用、效益不足、無法加量或疑似 tolerance 而採用（A～C）。轉換時先估算等止痛劑量，考慮不完全 cross-tolerance，常須視病況減少約 25–50%（D），再臨床滴定；若原藥鎮痛不佳，也不應先把新 opioid 計算劑量機械式增加 50–100%，因此 E 錯。Methadone、fentanyl 及特定轉換另有特殊規則。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"Merck Manual opioid conversion table","url":"https://www.merckmanuals.com/professional/multimedia/table/equianalgesic-doses-of-opioid-analgesics"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-23","year":113,"number":23,"topic":"未分類","text":"病人已服用長效型 Oxycodone CR (20mg) 2# q12h，同時其突發痛使用口服嗎啡之劑量 (Rescue dose)為短效型 Oxycodone (5mg) 2#，且每天平均使用 4 次，才能有效控制其疼痛， 請問如何調整其新的劑量？下列論述只有一項為正確，請指出。","options":["目前每天使用長效型 Oxycodone CR 之總劑量 = 60mg /天。","目前每天突發痛使用短效型 Oxycodone 之總劑量 = 20mg /天。","調整為新的長效型 Oxycodone CR (20mg) 每日總劑量 = 80mg /天。","新的突發痛處置使用之短效型 Oxycodone (5mg)劑量為 = 1# prn。","為使病人有效且方便，轉換為強效型 Hydromorphone SR (8mg) 2-3# qd。"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 E，但本題計算與單位非常容易誤讀：長效 oxycodone 20 mg×2 顆×每 12 小時一次＝80 mg/day（A 60 mg 錯）；突破痛速效 oxycodone 5 mg×2 顆×每日 4 次＝40 mg/day（B 20 mg 錯）；合計約 120 mg/day，因此 C 80 mg/day 不算把 rescue 合併後的調整。若轉口服 hydromorphone，還需以等效換算及不完全交叉耐受降劑量判斷，E 的 8 mg×2–3 顆每日可能反映考題所採換算，卻不能僅憑題面保證是所有病人的安全處方。D 的 5 mg 單顆 rescue 對既有突破痛需求可能不足。題幹同時把『口服嗎啡』與『速效 oxycodone』混稱，應視為筆誤。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":["題面速效 oxycodone 誤稱口服嗎啡，hydromorphone 換算需依等效表與交叉耐受，非唯一安全劑量"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-24","year":113,"number":24,"topic":"未分類","text":"當病人一再來門診或急診要求注射成癮性止痛藥時，下列哪些現象暗示病患可能有「成癮」 現象？","options":["病人抱怨最近的處方的止痛時間不夠久，藥效變差","病人抱怨最近疼痛加重厲害，發作頻繁，他把三天的藥一天吃完","病人自述出現嗜睡、噁心、性欲降低、便秘，但是疼痛都沒有減輕","病人自述沒吃止痛藥會睡不著，希望睡前加重劑量輔助睡眠","病人最近反覆敘述藥物遺失，而且發生很多次"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。反覆聲稱藥物遺失、多次提前要求補藥，屬需要進一步評估可能失控使用的警訊（E）。A 藥效時間縮短、B 疼痛惡化與超量使用、C 副作用、D 失眠要求加藥，都不能單獨診斷成癮。應依 DSM-5 OUD criteria、疼痛病情、藥物調整與心理社會因素綜合評估，勿將病人一概貼標籤。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":9,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-25","year":113,"number":25,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於纖維肌痛症 (fibromyalgia) 的定義，下列哪一項為 1990 年 ACR 的舊定義，而不屬於 2010 年的新定義：","options":["廣泛性疼痛(widespread pain index, WPI)為計算疼痛分布在身體 19 個區塊的數量","疼痛部位需分布在身體的上、下、左、右、及中軸等部位","症狀嚴重度 (Symptom Severity Scale, SSS)包括疲憊程度、記憶力減弱、睡眠不足","SSS 還包括身體症狀，如頭痛、下腹痛、憂鬱等症狀","身體症狀是指過去半年內曾發生的病史"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。ACR 1990 fibromyalgia criteria 要求 chronic widespread pain 涵蓋左右、上下、軀幹軸線，並以 18 處 tender points 其中至少 11 處評估；2010 準則轉向 WPI 與 SSS（A、C、D），不再要求 tender points。E 所述觀察期間需對照原文。2016 再修訂加入 5 區中至少 4 區 widespread/generalized pain，因此『2010 不含、2016 再納入』須按版本區分。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chapter 48; p660-661","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"2016 ACR fibromyalgia criteria revision","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK279092/table/fibromyalgia.T.2016_revisions_to_the_201/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":9,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-26","year":113,"number":26,"topic":"未分類","text":"Quantitative Sensory Test (QST) 作為疼痛測量的診斷工具，下列敘述何錯誤：","options":["可適用於神經病變性 (Neuropathic) 疼痛及傷害性 (nociceptive) 疼痛病人的測量","測量方法，可對不同疼痛性質的閾值做半定量測量，包括：熱痛/冷痛 (thermal pain)、機 械性疼痛 (mechanical pain)、及化學性疼痛 (chemical pain)","可以區別 hypoesthesia/hyperesthesia, hypoalgesia/hyperalgesia, 和 allodynia","可以測試小纖維感覺神經與痛感之神經病變有關","包含在台灣健保給付項目內"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。標準 quantitative sensory testing（QST）以定量、可重複的刺激測試 thermal detection/pain thresholds、mechanical detection/pain thresholds、vibration 等，對 sensory gain/loss（C）與小纖維功能（D）有幫助；不是常規用『化學性疼痛閾值』做一整套標準化的 QST，因此 B 混入 chemical pain 不恰當。A 可用於不同疼痛機轉的 sensory phenotyping。E 涉及台灣健保是否給付，需再向最新支付標準核對，不能由生理學推論。","officialNote":"解釋：(B) 無法測試化學性疼痛; (E) 健保碼 20033B NT$720; 考題出處：Page 1142; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019.;","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":9,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-27","year":113,"number":27,"topic":"未分類","text":"依據 2012 年 IASP 布達佩斯診斷標準(Budapest Diagnostic Criteria)定義的「複雜性局部疼痛 症候群」(complex regional pain syndrome, CRPS)，下列何者錯誤：","options":["為局部性的持續性疼痛，大部分為侷限於某神經皮節或特定的神經支配區域","異常的表現，包括感覺性、運動性、流汗性 (sudomotor)、血管性(vasomotor)、及營養性 (trophic) 等變化","疼痛的程度，會與原本造成傷害的疾病或病變應有的正常強度表現，不成比率","布達佩斯標準中，不需要區分第一型或第二型 CRPS","布達佩斯標準中，對臨床診斷及研究型診斷有不同的標準"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Budapest criteria 中的 CRPS 疼痛是 regional pain，通常**不**限定於單一 dermatome 或特定周邊神經領域，因此 A 錯。B 包含 sensory、vasomotor、sudomotor/edema、motor/trophic 四類；C 為與誘發事件不成比例的持續疼痛；D CRPS type I/II 不是使用 Budapest criteria 時必須先分的診斷流程；E clinical 與 research criteria 的敏感度／特異性設定不同。","officialNote":"解釋： (A) The pain is regional (not in a specific nerve territory or dermatome) 考題出處：Page 1199; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019.","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"CRPS Practical Diagnostic and Treatment Guidelines, 5th ed","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9186375/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-28","year":113,"number":28,"topic":"未分類","text":"下肢截肢後造成的幻肢痛(phantom limb pain)及/或 殘肢痛(Residual limb pain, stump pain)， 是極困難處理的慢性神經病變性疼痛。以下關於這類疼痛的介入治療或非藥物非侵入治療的 敘述，何者較不正確？","options":["肉毒桿菌注射殘肢的肌痛點、皮下、或附近周邊神經可減輕殘肢痛","Repetitive transcranial magnetic stimulation (rTMS) 跟 spinal cord stimulation (SCS) 具臨床 有意義的止痛效果，但 rTMS 效果比 SCS 短","斷肢再次手術處理周邊神經瘤，可能減輕殘肢痛","鏡像反射治療 (Mirror image therapy) 或沉浸式虛擬實境 (immersive virtual reality, IVR) 可改變大腦迴路，減輕幻肢痛","TENS 及針灸已被證實效果不好，臨床價值不高"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Mirror therapy／immersive VR（D）、neuroma surgery（C）、某些神經調控與 rTMS（B）及特定 botulinum 注射（A）均有不同程度的研究支持；證據品質、持續時間與病人選擇差異大。E 宣稱 TENS 和針灸已證明『都沒效、毫無價值』過度絕對，缺乏足夠直接比較試驗支持。要區分『證據不足』與『證明無效』，不應把各治療一概列為標準有效。","officialNote":"解釋：(E) “Investigators have reported good to excellent results in roughly 25% of patients treated with TENS” (page 1260) 考題出處：Page 1260-1264; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-29","year":113,"number":29,"topic":"未分類","text":"Ramsay-Hunt Syndrome 是帶狀皰疹的一種變異表現，以下的敘述何者較不正確？","options":["帶狀皰疹發生在耳朵及臉部，會在外耳郭及外耳道出現水泡及疼痛","病人會出現顏面神經麻痺，嘴角歪斜，失聰等現象","部分病人出現角膜炎，甚至失明","急性期或 post-herpetic neuralgia 的治療與其它帶狀皰疹類似","別名是 Herpes Zoster Oticus"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 C，但需區分 keratitis 的機轉。Ramsay Hunt syndrome（herpes zoster oticus）主要為 VZV 影響 geniculate ganglion／顏面神經，出現耳道水疱、耳痛、周邊性顏面麻痺，常可合併聽力、前庭症狀（A、B、E）；急性抗病毒與類固醇及 PHN 處理按情況調整（D）。C 的角膜炎／視力受損不是典型直接 V1 zoster ophthalmicus 表現，但顏面麻痺閉眼不全會導致暴露性角膜病變，因此『不可能發生』也不對，官方答案宜標註情境。","officialNote":"解釋：侵犯 CN VII 為主，可能同時影響 CN V, IX, and X；少影響眼部 考題出處：Page 1278-1279; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":["Ramsay Hunt 顏面麻痺可造成曝光性角膜病變，C 不是『不可能』；題意應是非典型直接 zoster ophthalmicus"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-30","year":113,"number":30,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列何者不是 Central pain 的原因？","options":["Stroke","Multiple sclerosis (MS)","Spinal cord injury (SCI)","Parkinson’s disease (PD)","Brachial plexus injury"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Stroke、MS 與 SCI 都能直接損傷 CNS pain pathways，引發 central neuropathic pain；Parkinson disease 也有 central pain phenotype（但非所有 Parkinson 病人的痛均為中樞痛）。Brachial plexus injury 位於周邊神經系統，造成的是 peripheral neuropathic pain，故 E 非 central pain 原因。","officialNote":"解釋：必須是中樞神經系統損傷後發生 考題出處：Page 1344; Bonica’s Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":11,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-31","year":113,"number":31,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the statement about dynamic mechanical allodynia is wrong?","options":["it is a positive symptom of neuropathic pain resulting from light tactile stimuli that would never be considered noxious in the absence of nervous system injury","this phenomenon reflects activity in low-threshold afferents that signal pain as a result of changes in the central nervous system as if they were nociceptive afferents","following peripheral nerve injury, a subpopulation of putative non-nociceptive afferents begins to express calcitonin gene-related peptide","one possible mechanism involves sprouting of non-nociceptive afferent, e.g., A-β afferents, into superficial laminae I and II of the dorsal horn to enable low threshold drive of nociceptive dorsal horn neurons but remains largely unsubstantiated","central sensitization has been suggested as a result of dynamic mechanical allodynia, reflecting activity in low-threshold afferents that signal pain as a result of changes in the central nervous system, but is still debated"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。A/B 反映低閾值 Aβ 觸覺傳入在中樞回路異常時引發 dynamic mechanical allodynia；C 宣稱非傷害性纖維受傷後開始表達 CGRP 並非普遍可確定的主要機制。D 的 Aβ sprouting 至淺層背角是歷史假說，但證據有限；E 中樞敏化與神經調控改變相關，惟不同患者路徑不一定相同。不能把單一動物模型當成病人必然機制。","officialNote":"Source: P34, Chapter 3: Peripheral pain mechanisms and nociceptor sensitization. In: Bonica's Management of Pain. Fifth Edition. Edited by Ballantyne JC, Fishman SM, and Rathmell JP. 2019. Wolters Kluwer. Following peripheral nerve injury that a subpopulation of putative nonnociceptive afferents begins to express the neuropeptide, substance P (Reference: Noguchi K, Dubner R, De Leon M, et al. Axotomy induces preprotachykinin gene expression in a subpopulation of dorsal root ganglion neurons. J Neurosci Res 1994;37(5):596–603.)","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":11,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-32","year":113,"number":32,"topic":"未分類","text":"The spinal cord is anatomically organized in laminae. Which statement is wrong?","options":["spinal dorsal horn neurons receiving excitatory inputs from nociceptive afferents throughout the dorsal horn but with particular localization to laminae I, II, V, VI, and X","small unmyelinated C fiber nociceptor endings for cutaneous somatic sensation are distributed mainly in laminae I and II, while for deep visceral afferents are distributed in ipsilateral laminae I, II, V, and X or contralateral V and X","large myelinated A-β fibers carries non-nociceptive input terminate in laminae III-V","noradrenergic and serotonergic inputs and inhibitory neurons with glycinergic and GABAergic enzymes are present in lamina V","estimated up to 25% of all spinothalamic neurons have been identified primarily nociceptive-specific neurons with small cutaneous receptive fields"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D，但此題**無清楚唯一錯誤**。A、B、C 概述背角 nociceptive 分布；D 說 lamina V 可見 noradrenergic/serotonergic fibers 與 GABA/glycine 抑制性神經，這些系統確實分布於多層背角，不能據『存在於 lamina V』就判錯；E 的『up to 25%』為特定估計，亦非固定定律。需要 Bonica 原文與圖表確認出題者是否指錯誤的特定定位或比例，保留官方 D 但列爭議。","officialNote":"Source: P39-41, Chapter 4: Substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing. Edited by Ballantyne JC, Fishman SM, and Rathmell JP. 2019. Wolters Kluwer. Neurons in lamina X are arranged around the central canal of the spinal cord. They receive bilateral inputs of unmyelinated, poorly myelinated, and highly myelinated afferents. Peptidergic inputs are extensive and immunohistochemical localization of noradrenergic and serotonergic inputs have been identified. Inhibitory neurons with immunohistochemical identification of glycinergic and GABAergic enzymes are locally present","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":11,"parseWarning":["D 說抑制性神經纖維存在 lamina V 本身可成立，難找唯一錯誤項"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-33","year":113,"number":33,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which statement about spinal cord nociceptive processing is wrong?","options":["spinothalamic tract, located within the ventrolateral white matter of the spinal cord, has been demonstrated en route to supraspinal sites with the predominant path for axonal projections traveling to the ipsilateral ventrobasal thalamus in responses to most somatic noxious stimuli","spinothalamic tract neurons have demonstrated a predominance for neurons processing nociceptive information","the soma of postsynaptic dorsal column neurons are located predominantly in lamina III, IV, and X, and the neurons have been demonstrated to be responsive to both somatic and visceral nociceptive inputs","glutamate is the primary excitatory amino acid neurotransmitter in afferent nociception","descending noradrenergic and serotonergic fibers originating in the brainstem produce inhibitory or excitatory effects on second-order spinal neurons, therefore serve as the mechanisms of descending inhibition or facilitation"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Spinothalamic tract 傳遞的軀體痛溫訊號多在脊髓交叉後沿 **contralateral** anterolateral system 上行，所以 A 寫到 ipsilateral ventrobasal thalamus 不對。B 該路徑包含 nociceptive neurons；C postsynaptic dorsal column 與某些內臟／深部感覺有關；D glutamate 是重要 fast excitatory neurotransmitter；E descending NE/5-HT 可依受體造成抑制或促通。","officialNote":"Source: P43-45, Chapter 4: Substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing. Edited by Ballantyne JC, Fishman SM, and Rathmell JP. 2019. Wolters Kluwer. Spinothalamic tract is located within the ventrolateral white matter of the spinal cord. Both ipsilateral and contralateral localization of axon pathways have been demonstrated en route to supraspinal sites, but the predominant path for axonal projections traveling to the ventrobasal thalamus resides on the contralateral side.","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":12,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-34","year":113,"number":34,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列何者不是肌筋膜疼痛(Myofascial pain syndrome)臨床治療的常見方式？","options":["Trigger point injection","Dry needling","Physical therapy: stretch, strengthening or stabilization","Platelet rich plasma injection on muscle belly","Laser"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。常規 myofascial pain syndrome 治療包含 exercise/physical therapy、stretching、trigger point injection、dry needling（A～C），某些光療或 laser（E）也曾研究；PRP 直接注射 muscle belly 並非廣泛接受的常規處置，證據有限，因此 D。治療應考慮功能復健，注射不是唯一方法。","officialNote":"來源：Ch. 35, treatment options","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":12,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-35","year":113,"number":35,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於纖維肌痛症(fibromylagia)的敘述，下列哪些正確？ 1- 纖維肌痛症發生率以男性較高 2- 纖維肌痛症的患者中壓痛點通常女性較男性多 3- 纖維肌痛症常常是許多其他慢性疼痛的共病(commobidity) 4- 因病人疼痛點多發且難治，應盡量讓病人多休息並限制運動 5- 較常見的藥物治療包含 gabapentinoids, tricyclic anti-depressants, selective norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor 或 opioid 等等","options":["1, 2, 4","1, 4, 5","1, 3, 5","2, 3, 5","2, 4, 5"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D（2、3、5），但選項 5 包含 opioids 與現行建議不符。1 說男性較常見，錯；2 舊 tender-point 資料中女性較多，3 FM 與其他慢性疼痛可共存，4 主張限制運動錯；5 的 gabapentinoids、TCA、SNRI 部分有適應情境，但『opioid』若指強效 opioid，目前 EULAR 建議避免。故官方組合 D 有歷史背景，臨床不能把強效 opioid 視為常規 FM 治療。","officialNote":"來源：Ch. 36, fibromyalgia","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"EULAR fibromyalgia treatment recommendations","url":"https://ard.bmj.com/content/76/2/318"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":13,"parseWarning":["官方選項 5 包含 opioid，現行 FM 指引反對長期強效 opioid 作常規治療"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-36","year":113,"number":36,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於胸廓出口症候群(Thoracic outlet syndrome, TOS)，以下何者有誤？","options":["只要在 supraclavicular fossa 有 tenderness，即可確定診斷。","依照被壓迫或阻塞的結構可以分為 arterial type, venous type 以及 neurogenic type","最常見造成壓迫的結構是 scalene muscles 以及 first rib","Neurogenic TOS 若經過簡單 hydrodissection/hydrorelease 仍然無效後，可考慮對 scalene muscles 做 botulinium toxin A 注射，或者進行 decompressive surgery","懷疑 Neurogenic TOS 時仍需進一步排除其他頸椎病變"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Supraclavicular fossa 壓痛缺乏足夠 specificity，不能單憑一個 tenderness 就診斷 thoracic outlet syndrome（TOS）。B 有 neurogenic、venous、arterial 分型；C scalene/first rib 周圍可能壓迫；D 治療從復健到選定注射或手術，證據及病人選擇各異；E 須排除 cervical radiculopathy、周邊 entrapment 與其他鑑別。","officialNote":"來源：Ch. 39, Pain due to thoracic outlet syndrome. (A) Cervical radiculopathy 為常見需要排除 的鑑別診斷。","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":13,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-37","year":113,"number":37,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於纖維肌痛症(fibromylagia)的臨床診斷，何者有誤？","options":["診斷要件中包括兩大類：widespread pain index(WPI)以及 symptoms severity score(SSS)","症狀需持續三個月以上","疼痛發生的區域分為左/右側上肢、左/右側下肢以及中軸軀幹等五區，須至少有四區以上 疼痛才可診斷為 fibromylagia","Symptom severity score 中須確認病人是否有疲倦、睡不飽、認知功能障礙、頭痛、下腹 絞痛或憂鬱等問題。","纖維肌痛症的診斷確定後可確認病人沒有其他疼痛原因"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。FM 診斷可用 WPI 與 symptom severity scale（A），需持續至少 3 個月（B），2016 ACR 增列至少 5 區中 4 區廣泛疼痛（C），SSS 反映疲倦、不清醒睡眠、認知與額外症狀（D）。**診斷 FM 不排除另有其他疼痛疾病**；2016 criteria 明言 FM 可與其他診斷並存，因此 E 錯。C 屬 2016 版，不應誤認 2010 年原始版也明列。","officialNote":"來源：Ch. 36, fibromyalgia and ACR 2016 criteria for fibromyalgia","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"ACR 2016 FM diagnostic criteria","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK279092/table/fibromyalgia.T.2016_revisions_to_the_201/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":13,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-38","year":113,"number":38,"topic":"未分類","text":"Vascular claudication 與 neurogenic claudication 在疼痛診斷中，常常造成判斷的困難，並影 響病人檢查及治療方向甚鉅。以下是常用來幫助區分兩者的線索，何者較不正確？","options":["若病人有 muscle atrophy 時，屬於 neurogenic claudication 的機會較大","若病人在站姿時，因腰部姿勢會產生症狀變化，則 neurogenic claudication 的機會較大","Vascular claudication 有較大可能有 skin trophic changes","騎腳踏車時產生下肢疼痛在 neurogenic pain 比較常見","Neurogenic claudication 的疼痛比較常見是由腰臀部往遠端擴張，而 vascular claudication 常常是在遠端較為疼痛"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Neurogenic claudication 常因腰椎伸展／直立姿勢惡化，坐下或前彎（包括騎腳踏車姿勢）改善；vascular claudication 主要受運動耗氧影響，騎車也可能誘發。因此 D 說騎腳踏車更常引起 neurogenic pain 錯。B 姿勢改變、C trophic changes、E 痛區起始位置及 A 肌萎縮均是輔助線索，但單一徵象不足以確診，必要時評估 ABI 與腰椎影像。","officialNote":"來源：Ch. 38, Pain due to vascular disorders","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-39","year":113,"number":39,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關鑑別 retroperitoneal cancer 造成 back pain 的 Retroperitoneal pain stretch maneuver 何者錯誤?","options":["病人於病床 sit upright 後逐漸將床放平","可以考慮於膝蓋下置放枕頭增加診斷率","有時需要放平數分鐘後疼痛才會逐漸增強","需先排除病患的背痛來源是 spine 或 paraspinal muscle","此類病人常抱怨無法躺平睡覺"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。題目描述 retroperitoneal lesion 的 pain stretch maneuver：病人由坐姿逐漸躺平、腰髖伸展可能牽拉腹膜後病灶而誘發延遲背痛（A、C、E），並需先排除脊椎或旁脊椎疼痛來源（D）。膝下放枕頭反而使髖膝屈曲、可能減少腹膜後及 psoas 區張力，因此 B 不是提升診斷率的方法。此舊式 bedside maneuver 尚非經充分前瞻驗證的確診試驗，若有癌症紅旗需影像評估。","officialNote":"考題出處： Chap41, Fig 41.5","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-40","year":113,"number":40,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關重要 cancer pain syndrome 的敘述何項正確?","options":["odontoid process metastasis 造成之 atlantoaxial subluxation 的典型疼痛會因 extension 而 加劇","Metastasis to clivus of sphenoid bone and basilar portion of occipital bone 的典型疼痛是眼 窩後劇痛且因 extension 而加劇","Jugular foramen 附近的 metastatic lesion 可能造成 6th Cranial nerve 的症狀而造成 diplopia","Occipital condyle metastasis 的主要疼痛為 focal occipital headache 且因 neck flexion 而加 劇","Leptomeningeal carcinomatosis 因為 involve meninges, 因此以 neck stiffness 為主要表現"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Occipital condyle syndrome 常以局部枕部痛、頸部活動（尤其 flexion）惡化，可能合併 XII cranial nerve palsy，故 D 合乎典型描述。A、B 在 atlantoaxial／clivus metastasis 的方向與疼痛定位不符或過度特定；C jugular foramen syndrome 常涉及 IX–XI，不是典型 VI nerve palsy（後者較常見於 clival/petrous apex 病變）；E leptomeningeal carcinomatosis 可呈多灶神經症狀，不僅頸僵。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 42, table 42.14","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-41","year":113,"number":41,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列鴉片類藥物使用於 severe chronic renal insufficiency 或 hemo/peritoneal dialysis 病患的 分類何項正確","options":["Hydromorphone -> Preferred, single dose safe","Fentanyl (transdermal) -> Potentially acceptable, use with caution","Morphine (immediate release) -> preferred, single dose safe","Fentanyl (transmucosal, rapid-onset-opioid) -> Avoid use","Oxycodone controlled release (OxyContin) -> preferred, dialysable"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 A，但對嚴重腎衰的 opioid 選擇需慎重。Morphine 代謝物 M3G/M6G 在腎衰可能累積，C 不適宜；hydromorphone 母藥可供選定病人使用，但 H3G 亦可能在腎功能差時累積，故 A 所謂『preferred, single dose safe』僅能理解為部分情況可作謹慎選擇，不是所有單次劑量都安全。Fentanyl patch 在 opioid-naïve 者尤其不適合，B 隨臨床脈絡可為可能選項；D、E 一概化的分類也不可靠。須依 eGFR、透析方式與既有 opioid tolerance 調整。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 43, table 43.9","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":["Hydromorphone 在嚴重腎衰仍有 H3G 累積與神經毒性可能；A 的 single dose safe 說法過度絕對"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-42","year":113,"number":42,"topic":"未分類","text":"針對上腹部腫瘤(例如胰臟癌)合併嚴重癌症疼痛常用的介入性處置, 下列敘述何者正確?","options":["針對 Celiac ganglion/Splanchnic plexus 進行 neurolytic block","Neurolytic block 使用的藥物是長效的局部麻醉藥","針對 Ganglion impar 進行 neurolytic block","針對 superior hypogastric plexus 進行 neurolytic block","神經阻斷的處置因位於脊椎附近, 因此常會造成病患下肢癱瘓的併發症"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。胰臟癌或其他上腹部臟器癌症之嚴重內臟痛可考慮 celiac plexus 或 splanchnic neurolysis，以 ethanol 或 phenol 達到神經毀損效果（A）；B 長效局麻藥只暫時阻斷，非化學性 neurolysis。Ganglion impar 主處理會陰／尾骨區（C），superior hypogastric plexus 偏骨盆內臟痛（D）。E 截癱等重大併發症雖少見但非『常會』發生，需解釋出血、低血壓與神經風險。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 44, common sense","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-43","year":113,"number":43,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關 pediatric cancer pain 的敘述何項正確?","options":["pediatric cancer pain 容易被 undertreatment 是因為兒童對於 opioid analgesic 的反應不佳 止痛效果不好","pediatric cancer pain 的 intensity 只能依靠病童 self report","leukemia 病童的 bone cancer pain 是因為 bone cortex 被 leukemic cell invasion","pediatric cancer pain 由 anticancer treatment 引起的多於 disease 本身","chemotherapy 造成的 oral mucositis 疼痛以使用 oral morphine 止痛為首選"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D，但出題引用的兒童癌痛來源比例須回查原始研究。A 兒童癌痛 undertreatment 不等於 opioid 無效；B 幼兒可用 FLACC 等行為量表，不是只能 self-report；C leukemia 骨痛常與骨髓浸潤、骨膜張力／炎症有關，非單純 bone cortex invasion；E 口腔黏膜炎要依吞嚥能力、感染與疼痛強度選止痛途徑，口服 morphine 不是唯一首選。D『治療引起疼痛多於疾病本身』在某些兒童腫瘤資料成立，不能外推所有癌種與階段。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap49","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":["兒童癌痛 disease vs treatment 來源比例受癌種與研究定義影響"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-44","year":113,"number":44,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which opioid will be increased or decreased in plasma concentration through induction or inhibition of CYP3A4/ CYP450 ?","options":["Morphine","Oxycodone","Hydromorphone","meperidine","All of the above opioids may be affected"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 A **高度可能為錯誤答案鍵**。Morphine 主要由 UGT2B7 進行 glucuronidation 形成 M3G/M6G，並不是 CYP3A4 誘導／抑制作用的典型 opioid；Oxycodone（選項 B）則明確經 CYP3A4 代謝，抑制劑可能提高血中濃度，誘導劑降低濃度。Hydromorphone 亦以 glucuronidation 為主。保留原卷 A 作為『官方鍵』，但醫學上更支持 B。","officialNote":"考題出處：page 4154-4160, Chapter 79. Opioid Analgesics","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"FDA oxycodone CYP3A4 interactions","url":"https://www.dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?audience=professional&setid=6b6db42b-9821-4aa6-8566-297037d84079"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":["Morphine 主要 UGT glucuronidation，而 oxycodone 經 CYP3A4；官方 A 與藥物代謝機轉衝突"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-45","year":113,"number":45,"topic":"未分類","text":"TCA (tricyclic antidepressant) is commonly suggested to be the first-line neuropathic pain drug, and which of the following description about TCA is not advisable?","options":["The analgesic efficacy of the TCAs is likely to be independent of their antidepressant effect","Secondary amine TCAs (e.g., desipramine, nortriptyline) are better tolerated than tertiary amine TCAs (e.g., amitriptyline, imipramine) but are less effective in analgesia","Use of a low initial dose and slow dose titration of all TCAs is important to minimize premature discontinuation due to side effects","The anticholinergic effects of TCAs can cause cardiac toxicity including ventricular ectopic activity, prolonged QT interval, myocardial infarction, and sudden death","All of the above are correct."],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。Secondary-amine TCAs 如 nortriptyline、desipramine 一般較 tertiary amines（amitriptyline 等）耐受，卻不能一概聲稱止痛效力明顯較差，因此 B 不恰當。A 抗神經病變痛作用可獨立於抗憂鬱效果；C 低劑量起始、緩慢加量能改善耐受；D 抗膽鹼、心臟傳導與 QT 風險需注意，尤其高齡／心臟病。","officialNote":"考題出處：Page, 4204-4205, Chapter 81. Neuropathic Pain Pharmacotherapy","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":16,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-46","year":113,"number":46,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which description in comparison between gabapentin and pregabalin is wrong?","options":["both exert their analgesic effect by binding to the α2δ subunit of voltage-gated calcium channels on primary afferent neurons","both have linear pharmacokinetics","few or no drug interactions occur with gabapentin and pregabalin","both are first-line therapy for post-herpetic neuralgia and peripheral diabetic neuralgia","All of the above are correct"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。Pregabalin 的吸收與血中濃度呈接近線性劑量關係，且口服生體可用率大於 90%；gabapentin 腸道轉運有飽和現象，劑量上升時吸收比例下降，故**並非兩者都線性 PK**。A 作用於 α2δ voltage-gated calcium-channel subunit 而非 GABA receptor；C 與肝 CYP 交互作用少；D 均常用於 PHN／痛性糖尿病周邊神經病變。","officialNote":"考題出處：Page, 4206, 4213-14, Chapter 81. Neuropathic Pain Pharmacotherapy","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"Gabapentin vs Pregabalin pharmacokinetics review","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20818832/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":16,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-47","year":113,"number":47,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於 spinal cord stimulation（SCS）造成的生理機轉與功能影響，下列何者不正確？","options":["可導致 dorsal horn(DH)釋放 γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA)。","SCS 亦可使 cholinergic neurons 活化 M4 and M2 muscarinic type receptors (Ach).","在高位胸椎可能藉由穩定 intrinsic cardiac nervous system，進而減少 ischemia 和 pain。","在中低位胸椎可減少 colonic spasm 進而減少疼痛。","在低位胸椎可造成周邊血管收縮，藉以保暖。"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。SCS 可經 dorsal horn GABA、cholinergic／muscarinic 機制等影響神經調節（A、B），高胸段在特定情況可影響缺血／心絞痛（C），某些內臟痛研究探討中低胸段效應（D）。E 說低胸段 SCS 一般透過**周邊血管收縮**達到保暖，與神經調控通常可改善局部灌流／血管擴張的目標不符，故 E。其他機轉證據也主要依特定模式及臨床適應症。","officialNote":"關於 spinal cord stimulation（SCS）造成的生理機轉與功能影響，下列何者不正確？(P.1572, Fig.96.2; P.1577, Fig.96.6)","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":16,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-48","year":113,"number":48,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於 lumbar intervertebral disk，下列何者最不正確？","options":["在一個 injured intervertebral disk of lumbar region，我們通常看到 internal stress 在 anterior anulus 比較高，故在影像上通常產生往後 bulging 的結果。","在 The grading of radial fissures in internal disk disruption 中，III 級裂隙是到達 anulus 的外 三分之一。如果它們沿著 anulus 外環周向延伸變成 circumferential fissure，則成為 IV 級 裂隙。","若在 posterior anulus 發現 High-intensity zones (HIZ)，表示在橫切面下已經出現一個 circumferential fissure。約有 20%至 30%的慢性腰痛患者會出現這種情況，並且與受影響 產生的椎間盤疼痛相關。","MRI 中在不正常 disk 上方的 spongiosa of the vertebral body，常會看到 type 1 或 type 2 的 Modic lesions。","Internal disk disruption 的過度壓力會刺激外環內的 nociceptive receptor，退化的 nucleus 則 會產生發炎物質，當它們穿過 fissures of anulus 到達外環的神經末梢時，可以刺激神經末 梢產生化學傷害感受。如果新的神經纖維被 fissure 吸引而長到椎間盤中，這兩種機制都 會被放大。"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。椎間盤的內部應力、後方纖維環 fissure、發炎與 nociceptor ingrowth 的關係複雜；A 把『anterior annulus 應力通常較高』直接推論成 posterior bulging 的必要原因，不合理。B radial/circumferential fissure 是形態分類；C posterior annular HIZ 的病理與盛行率因研究而異，不能單獨確診 discogenic pain；D Modic 是 endplate adjacent vertebral marrow 的 MRI 訊號變化；E biochemical irritation 可參與疼痛。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":17,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-49","year":113,"number":49,"topic":"未分類","text":"About morphine, which of the following is wrong?","options":["Critical care guidelines recommend morphine as an acceptable first-line agent for pain in the ICU but advise that morphine may cause hypotension due to systemic release of histamine.","Both animal and human studies have demonstrated significant histamine and nitric oxide release with morphine, with subsequent decreases in systemic vascular resistance, bronchospasm, and urticaria.","Morphine is metabolized in the liver to morphine-3-glucuronide (M3G) and morphine-6-glucuronide (M6G), both of which are subsequently cleared by the kidneys.","The M3G metabolite is 2 to 8 times more potent than morphine as an analgesic.","In critically ill patients, the altered protein binding resulting from malignancy, renal impairment, and hepatic failure may also alter morphine pharmacokinetics and make dosing titration challenging."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Morphine 在肝臟 glucuronidation 成 M3G 與 M6G，兩者腎排除（C）；**M6G** 具有活性、可止痛及造成呼吸抑制，**M3G** 沒有臨床主要止痛作用，累積時可與 neuroexcitation 相關，所以 D 說 M3G 比 morphine 強 2–8 倍為錯。A、B morphine 可誘發組織胺與血管擴張；E 重症器官功能變化會影響 PK。","officialNote":"page: 5435-5436","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":17,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-113-50","year":113,"number":50,"topic":"未分類","text":"About methadone, which of the following is wrong?","options":["Methadone is a unique analgesic with multiple mechanisms of action which contribute to its antinociceptive effects.","These mechanisms are centrally mediated through agonism at the μ-opioid receptor, antagonism at the NMDA receptor, and inhibition of serotonin and norepinephrine reuptake.","The primary indications for use of methadone include chronic pain and prevention of opioid withdrawal.","Using methadone for acute pain is challenging secondary to the need for slow and gradual uptitration every 2 to 3 weeks.","Methadone is highly lipophilic leading to its relatively quick onset of action, a “drug-depot” effect throughout the tissues, and an extended halflife."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Methadone 為 μ-opioid agonist，兼具 NMDA antagonism 與單胺再回收抑制特性，半衰期長而變異大，可能蓄積（A、B、E）；既用於 OUD 維持治療亦可治慢性痛（C）。D 把慢慢加量『每 2–3 週』與『不能處理急性痛』直接連成原因，與實務的多模態急性鎮痛及 methadone 訂定滴定期原則混淆；急性痛不是 methadone 的常規快速滴定用途，需監測 QT 與遲發呼吸抑制。","officialNote":"page: 5438","sources":[{"title":"113 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"113.pdf","page":17,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"}]);
